      "content": "That sounds perfect. I was a bit worried because I heard a rumor from one of the junior attaches that it might be taken as a slight against the local leadership's integrity... but if you're sure it's just a general proverb about politics, I'll stick with it. Are there any specific tones or contexts I should keep in mind so I don't accidentally sound disrespectful?",
